<section id="S4" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">4 </span>Experiment</h2>

<section id="S4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.1 </span>Experimental Setup</h3>

<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Architecture exploration on different numbers of selected neurons <math id="S4.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{K}_{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mtext>K</mtext><mi>N</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{K}_{N}</annotation></semantics></math>. MoNE exhibits better downstream performance when the selected rate is <math id="S4.T3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1/4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1/4</annotation></semantics></math>. </figcaption>
<div id="S4.T3.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:397.5pt;height:95.4pt;vertical-align:-46.1pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-109.5pt,26.3pt) scale(0.644819257067012,0.644819257067012) ;">
