<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>LLM Usage</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This study utilizes Large Language Models (LLMs) to refine content, adjust formatting, construct
tables, and provide writing suggestions for specific chapters.</p>
</div>
